    "description": {
      "en": "Income threshold of EUR 1,000,000 that marks the top band limit for couples under the CEHR exceptional contribution on high incomes. In tin_fr's SchedCalc function it is used as the Band_UpLim of the couples' schedule (comment: 'Exceptional contributions on high income earners: couples'), the point above which the top 4% rate applies to a couple's reference tax income (RFR), following the 0% band up to EUR 500,000 and the 3% band between EUR 500,000 and EUR 1,000,000."
